--- !u!114 &1892682201
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1892682198}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2c8360bb7b1c4b2b862663d1c184e45, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VoiceLines
  radio: {fileID: 1892682199}
  captions: {fileID: 1417538499}
  localVoice: {fileID: 1335939006}
  radioVoice: {fileID: 1974271247}
  lines:
  - id: lou_00
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: "\u2014am? Sam, please. Anyone. Over."
  - id: lou_01
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Sam?! I've been calling for hours. I hid to jump out at you, and then
      I was falling, and now it's pitch black. I don't know where I am. My flashlight
      broke.
  - id: lou_02
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Boxes, I think. Sheets. And something laughs every time I move.
  - id: lou_02b
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: That!
  - id: lou_03
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: My batteries are almost dead. I'm gonna hold the button down so you
      can hear what I hear. Bang on stuff, Sam. I'll tell you if it's close.
  - id: lou_04
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Was that you? I heard it in the pipe... but it's everywhere.
  - id: lou_05
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: I hear you. Keep going.
  - id: lou_06
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: That was far away.
  - id: lou_07
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: The laugh again... no, that one sounded different. Closer.
  - id: lou_08
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Closer... I think.
  - id: lou_09
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Warmer.
  - id: lou_10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Close... but not there.
  - id: lou_11
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: "That! That's right next to me! Sam, I think that's what I fell out
      of... the light's blinking... please don't leave me down h\u2014"
  - id: lou_12
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: BOO!
  - id: lou_13
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Got you.
  - id: lou_14
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Did you get the Knocking Ghost on tape?
  - id: sam_00
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lou? I fell asleep. Are you there? Over.
  - id: sam_01
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lou! It's me! I fell asleep. Where are you?
  - id: sam_02
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: What's down there with you?
  - id: sam_03
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: She can't hear me while she's holding it.
  - id: sam_04
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Not without Lou.
  - id: sam_05
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Just pumpkin bread.
  - id: sam_06
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Just a wall.
  - id: sam_07
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Mom's PTA radio. It was stuck on talk the whole time.
  - id: sam_08
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lou's candy pail. She was in here.
  - id: sam_09
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: If I go down too, there's nobody to crank us back up.
  - id: sam_10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lou? Lou, can you hear me?
  - id: sam_11
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: She's at the bottom of that lift. I have to get her up.
  - id: sam_12
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Lou! The cupboard's back! Follow my voice!
  - id: sam_13
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Keep coming! You're close!
  - id: sam_14
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Climb in. I'll pull you up.
  - id: sam_15
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Yeah. It was you.
  - id: sam_h1
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: Something's glowing under that crate.
  - id: sam_h2
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: If she's holding the button, anything loud near her should come through.
  - id: sam_h3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: She said she fell. Fell from where?
  - id: sam_h4
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: The crank... I could send the lift down to her.
  - id: sam_h5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: She can't see it. It's pitch black down there.
  - id: sam_h6
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: She needs something to follow.
  - id: sam_h7
    clip: {fileID: 0}
    caption: The PTA radio... if she could hear me down there.
--- !u!114 &1892682202
